speechtext:
With the permission of the committee I will read the amendment submitted by the hon. member for Peace River. This is the proposed amendment to clause 1 of Bill C-231:
By adding after (c) the following:
Provided however that it is essential to recognize the policy of equalization of freight rates to the fullest possible extent as a means of dealing equitably with all parts of Canada and as being the method best calculated to facilitate the interchange of commodities between the various parts of the country as well as the encouragement of industry and agriculture in all regions and the development of export trade;
